@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = YOUR_ADMIN_SANCTUM_TOKEN

### ============================================================
### DAY 17 — CONTACT INBOX
### ============================================================

### Inbox

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Search by Email

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages?search=admin@example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Search by Subject

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages?search=ChatGPT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Only New Messages

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages?status=new
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Only Read Messages

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages?status=read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Message Details (Marks Read)

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json




#### Start from here

### ============================================================
### DAY 17 — MARK AS READ
### ============================================================

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### DAY 17 — ARCHIVE MESSAGE
### ============================================================

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages/1/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### DAY 17 — RESTORE MESSAGE
### ============================================================

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages/1/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### DAY 17 — DELETE MESSAGE
### ============================================================

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact/messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json